{"id": "section-body-00631", "title": "Rapid Sequence Intubation (RSI)", "chapterId": "chapter-one", "blocks": [{"id": "body-00631", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Rapid Sequence Intubation (RSI)", "runs": [{"text": "Rapid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Sequence"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Intubation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(RSI)"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1890"}}, {"id": "body-00632", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Rapid sequence intubation (RSI) is an airway management technique that is focused on inducing immediate unresponsiveness by the use of induction agent followed by relaxation of the muscles using a neuromuscular blocking agent. RSI is the fastest and most effective method of controlling the airway.", "runs": [{"text": "Rapid sequence intubation (RSI) is an airway management technique that is focused on inducing immediate unresponsiveness by the use of induction agent followed by relaxation of the muscles using a neuromuscular blocking agent. RSI is the fastest and most effective method of controlling the airway."}]}, {"id": "body-00633", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Use this checklist to make sure all equipment is ready (Mnemonic: SOAP ME).", "runs": [{"text": "Use"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "this"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "checklist"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "make"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "all"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "equipment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ready"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Mnemonic:"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "SOAP"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "ME)."}]}, {"id": "body-00634", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Suction - suction apparatus, Yankauer, suction catheter", "runs": [{"text": "S", "bold": true}, {"text": "uction"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "-"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "suction"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "apparatus,"}, {"text"